abstract="This paper presents an efficient algorithm for computing 11th-power residue symbols in the cyclotomic field $Q(\zeta_{11})$ where $\zeta_{11}$ is a primitive 11th root of unity. It extends an earlier algorithm due to Caranay and Scheidler (Int. J. Number Theory, 2010) for the 7th-power residue symbol. The new algorithm finds applications in the implementation of certain cryptographic schemes.",
